OL,3,ACamilla admits it was 'difficult' to
OL,4,Akeep King's cancer diagnosis a secret
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen Camilla has spoken for the first
OL,7,Ftime about the pressure of keeping King
OL,8,FCharles III's cancer diagnosis secret
OL,9,Fin the early stages of treatment.
OL,11,FIn a video to mark the 30th anniversary
OL,12,Fof Maggie's cancer charity, the Queen,
OL,13,Fwho is president of the charity,
OL,14,Frecalls how "difficult" it was to avoid
OL,15,Fdiscussing her husband's treatment
OL,16,Fwhile on an official engagement with
OL,17,Fcancer patients and their families.
OL,19,FIn January 2024, the Queen opened a new
OL,20,FMaggie's cancer support centre at the
OL,21,FRoyal Free Hospital in London.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
