OL,3,ACamilla admits it was 'difficult' to
OL,4,Akeep King's cancer diagnosis a secret
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe had just found out that the King
OL,7,Fhad cancer and would need treatment but
OL,8,Fhad to hold back from telling anyone as
OL,9,Fthe official announcement had not been
OL,10,Fmade public.
